# State

Single source of truth for the orchestrator. Update it **before** and **after** every step
(spawn, gate, review, commit). Allowed statuses: `todo`, `implementing`, `gating`, `reviewing`,
`changes-requested`, `done`, `blocked`. `Round` is the current implementation round (1–3).

Baseline facts (filled by T00, HEAD aeb9c03): VS Code 1.141.0 · Node v24.21.0 · gate durations:
compile 2 s · unit 1 s · types 1 s · contracts 1 s · full 150 s (includes trusted, scroll, reload)
· visual 138 s · known baseline failures: visual 37/95 scenarios (65 signature lines in
`logs/visual-baseline-failures.txt`: sticky band vs toolbar row, table bar alignment, stale
narrow-header check); full: one flaky scroll-campaign timeout (`solo-block-anchored`, 1 of 3 runs).

